<style>
    .mp-card {
        background: #181920;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 18px;
    }
    .mp-card h6 { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .mp-row {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
    }
    .mp-avatar-lg { width: 88px; height: 88px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
    .mp-mini-avatar { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }

    /* Поиск */
    .mp-search-wrap { position: relative; width: 360px; max-width: 100%; }
    .mp-results {
        position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: calc(100% + 6px); z-index: 30;
        background: #181920; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .mp-result-item {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; cursor: pointer;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    .mp-result-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .mp-result-item:hover, .mp-result-item.active { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-color) 20%, transparent); }

    /* Бейджи: цвет с !important, потому что в style.css все <span> принудительно белые */
    .mp-badge {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
        font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .mp-badge-green  { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15);  color: #4ade80 !important; border-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.3); }
    .mp-badge-red    { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15);  color: #f87171 !important; border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.3); }
    .mp-badge-yellow { background: rgba(234,179,8,0.15);  color: #fbbf24 !important; border-color: rgba(234,179,8,0.3); }
    .mp-badge-gray   { background: rgba(107,114,128,0.2); color: #9ca3af !important; border-color: rgba(107,114,128,0.3); }
    .mp-badge-blue   { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color: #60a5fa !important; border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.3); }
    .mp-badge-accent {
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-color) 18%, transparent);
        color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-color) 55%, white) !important;
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-color) 40%, transparent);
    }

    .mp-role {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 9px;
    }
    .mp-role-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }

    .mp-stat { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; height: 100%; }

    .mp-bars { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 3px; height: 90px; }
    .mp-bar { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 4px; background: var(--accent-color); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; opacity: 0.85; }
    .mp-bar.empty { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); opacity: 1; }
    .mp-bars-labels { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.68rem; margin-top: 4px; }

    .mp-mention { background: rgba(88,101,242,0.3); color: #c9cdfb !important; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 4px; font-weight: 500; }
    .mp-details summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
    .mp-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .mp-copy-btn { background: transparent; border: none; padding: 0 4px; color: #9ca3af; cursor: pointer; }
    .mp-copy-btn:hover { color: #fff; }
</style>

<div class="container-fluid py-4" id="memberProfilePage" data-guild-id="<%= guildId %>">

    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-4 flex-wrap gap-3">
        <div>
            <h3 class="fw-bold text-white mb-1"><i class="bi bi-person-badge text-accent me-2"></i>Досье участника</h3>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Варны, заявки, активность, входы и заметки модераторов — всё об участнике на одной странице</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mp-search-wrap">
            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="mpSearchInput" autocomplete="off"
                   placeholder="Ник или ID участника..."
                   style="background:#181920; color:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
            <div class="mp-results" id="mpSearchResults" style="display:none;"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted text-center py-5 mb-0" id="mpEmpty">
        <i class="bi bi-search d-block fs-2 mb-2"></i>
        Введите ник или Discord ID участника.<br>
        <span class="small">Ник ищется среди участников сервера. Тех, кто уже вышел, можно найти по полному ID.</span>
    </p>

    <p class="text-muted text-center py-5 mb-0" id="mpLoading" style="display:none;">Загрузка досье...</p>
    <div class="alert alert-danger" id="mpError" style="display:none;"></div>

    <div id="mpContent" style="display:none;"></div>
</div>

<script src="/js/memberProfile.js"></script>
